script = ExtResource("1_7us4y")
using_states = PackedStringArray()
character_names = PackedStringArray()
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://dbs4435dsf3ry"


~ start
Brian: Margaret! Margaret!! We have to get out of here!
Margaret: Round and round the staircase twists in the endless spiral
Margaret: Walk them down or up as you wish, but you can't reach top nor bottom
Margaret: Walk them round and round until they stay still, and you start to spiral
Brian: MARGARET!!! Please! Snap out of it. We have to leave this place
Margaret: Round and round until you realize that you are the stairs, walked in spiral
Margaret: That there is no end nor begining but endles circle
Margaret: Look above, see the same exact stairs lining the ceiling
Margaret: or is it the floor? Can you tell whitch way is up and whitch down?
Margaret: How would you know, you have been walking both directions and reach nothing but more stairs
Brian: Came on, don't do this to me
- (grab her by the hand to lead her out)
	(As you try to grab her, your head starts spinning and you almost tumble down the stair)
	do SignalManager.fear.emit(5)
	- (Try it again)
		(Your head throbs with pain and you feel as if distorted into spiral shape for a moment)
		Brian: Why can't I reach you
		Margaret: I am already twisted
		Margaret: Pretty soon, you too will spin in sharp angles
		do SignalManager.fear.emit(10)
	- (try to use words)
		Brian: Margaret please. You know me. We are friends. We came here to explore this house.
		Brian: We need to leave. Come with me. Please, come before this place does something terrible to us
		Margaret: It's too late for that. We are already marked and distorted
		do SignalManager.fear.emit(5)
- (keep your distance)
=> END
~ start2
Brian: Margaret please, try to remember.
Brian: You came here with me
Brian: You can leave this place
Brian: Just come with me. I promise we will get out safely...
Margaret: Liar
Margaret: You cannot even protect yourself
Margaret: I am better of here, the stairs don't hurt
Margaret: The stairs don't lie
Margaret: The stairs don't pretend
Margaret: They just twist and turn down, up, down, up down
Brian:  Please. Stop. Stop the nonsence. Just come with me. We can still make it out! Please...
Margaret: Stop. Just stop. You know none of us will leave
Margaret: You know you lead us to our deaths
Margaret: You can feel it deep down in your bones
Margaret: You can lie to me. You can lie to this house
Margaret: But you cannot lie to yourself.
Margaret: Go, find the place to loose yourself. To distort youself. To become one with this house
(I cannot give up)
(I need to get out of here)
(Then I can figure out how to get her out)
(Trying to carry her and explore would not end well)
Brian: Margaret. I will prove to you there is a way out. I will find it.
Brian: And then, I will return to you. And you will come with me
Margaret: Farwell, Brian. May you go mad gently, old "friend"
do SignalManager.fear.emit(10)
=> END
~ cycle1
Margaret: The ceiling twists and turns and bends
Margaret: The stairs go round and round and round and round and round
Margaret: You may go up, in the vain hope of escape, or down
Margaret: Were you going up, or down? Can you tell
Margaret: How deep bellow the earth must you be now? Or far above the clouds?
Margaret: Time and space have no meaning here
Margaret: How long have you been going for? Days, weeks...
do SignalManager.fear.emit(5)
=> END
~ cycle2
Margaret: Once there was a staircase
Margaret: It lead up, up into the sky
Margaret: And down, into the earth
Margaret: There was noone to walk the staircase
Margaret: And so, it dreamed of being walked
Margaret: One day, it saw a human, just out of reach
Margaret: And so, it bend. It bend and streached to reach them
Margaret: To be walked
Margaret: And it did reach the human
Margaret: And the human walke down and up and down and up and down
Margaret: And there was nothing for him to find
Margaret: And the stairs bend and twisted
Margaret: And the human walked and walked, down, up, down, up, down
do SignalManager.fear.emit(5)
=> END
~ cycle3
Margaret: Once, there was a human
Margaret: A scared human
Margaret: A human that had friends
Margaret: They called her Margaret, and she lied to them that it was her name
Margaret: Or was it her name? And she lied the wasn't...
Margaret: She lied to them that she was brave
Margaret: She lied to them that she cared about them
Margaret: She lied to them that they cared about her
Margaret: Or did they lie to her about any of that
Margaret: Or did she lie to herself about that
Margaret: Or did they lie to themselves about that
Margaret: Whose to say. So many lies, that truth is lost beneath them
do SignalManager.fear.emit(10)
=> END